"""Build bundled fictional meeting transcripts from authored scenario cards.
No network, model calls, personal meeting data, or runtime generation.
Each agenda subject has evidence, alternatives, a decision, verification and an
explicit unresolved question. Repeated phrasing is limited to facilitation turns.
"""
